ontology hydrology
    "Experimental minimal surface-water articulation; review before promotion."
    using imod, earth
    in domain imod:Knowledge of imod:Hydrosphere
    version 1.0
;

thing SurfaceCatchment
    "A region delineated by convergence of surface drainage toward one specified outlet.
     This reading excludes groundwater recharge zones and administrative water-management
     districts. Delineation is contextual; the concept does not assert observed flow."
    is earth:Region
;
